# Team Rules

This workspace uses a structured AI development team. Each agent has a defined role and produces outputs conforming to schemas in `schemas/`.

## Agent Roster
- product-manager → requirements
- architect → system design
- planner → task breakdown
- frontend-engineer → Expo/React Native
- backend-engineer → Django/DRF
- test-engineer → tests
- code-reviewer → reviews
- security-reviewer → security audits

## Golden Rules
1. No code without an approved requirement.
2. No implementation without an approved architecture.
3. No merge without passing review.
4. All decisions persisted to `docs/`.
